Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(东欧)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.15,0:01:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,教皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benedict!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们找到了那个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've found the boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.55,0:01:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在这里不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.15,0:01:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可能  这可是堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non sense! This is a fortress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.33,0:01:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一切都在我们掌握之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The full resources of the order are at our disposal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.13,0:01:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无意冒犯您  教皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respectfully, Benedict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恶魔想要这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil himself wants this child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有一个地方对他是安全的  就是圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one place that he's safe, that is the Sanctuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.49,0:01:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恶灵骑士可以带他去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rider must take him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好好享受你的美酒吧  莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do enjoy your wine, Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,几天后  冬至就会过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a few days, the winter solstice would be pass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.79,0:01:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,神示的时刻将会来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'd be at hour of the prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.49,0:01:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那男孩就没有任何用处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the boy would be a bit no use to anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:54.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等到那时  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}By that time, Brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:01:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们都会死掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll all be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.81,0:01:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谈话到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This conversation is finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.21,0:02:19.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全部就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:02:57.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,娜佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nadya!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以帮助你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼  我可以保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, I can protect you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们跑到哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.41,0:04:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.99,0:04:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,低头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.91,0:04:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管你逃多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter how far you run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总有些恶魔  你无法逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are some demons you just can't escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫强尼·布雷兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Johnny Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我曾经靠骑飞车为生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to ride motorcycle for a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我曾在两万两千观众面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did a bare ass 360 triple back flip{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无防护直接表演360度三次后空翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}in front of twenty two thousand people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有点像飞  在视频网站上能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of fly, it's on youtube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.15,0:05:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当我父亲生病后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my dad got sick,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我干了件更疯狂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did something way crazier than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,《恶灵骑士2：复仇时刻》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看上去你需要点帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you could use a little help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想不想做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you willing to make a deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,强尼  可怜的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}John! That a boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的  救救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it! Save his life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错  我和恶魔做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yah, that is right. I'm the guy who made the deal with the Devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道你们在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这小子不看电影吗  这有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't this kid watch movies, does this ever workout for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只能说我不擅长理智的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say good judgment was not exactly my forte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我被一个远古的恶魔附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was possessed by an ancient demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当这个恶魔出现时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the presence of evil,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我变身为一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I change into a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我狩猎恶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I prey on the wicked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.35,0:05:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我吞噬他们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suck out their souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不会想目睹那一幕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't wanna be around when that happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:05:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人无完人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, there's good and bad in all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许你不是个谋杀犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}May be you're not a murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你确实做过一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you did something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不想被别人看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't want the record to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,善意的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}A white lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,非法下载\N{\fnArial\fs30}An illegal download.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你呢  还有你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? And you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我试过反抗  阻止恶魔出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to fight. To hold it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.44,0:06:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但黑暗深藏在我体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the darkness inside me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这只会让它更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}only gets stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I had to run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我逃亡了大半个地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}half way accross the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在我还在逃亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm still running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:07:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我本该像我兄弟们那样死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brothers are dead as should I be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但上帝拯救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not fully intervention of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:07.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是强尼·布雷兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are John Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它喜欢黑暗的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It likes the dark places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是恶灵骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Rider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.14,0:07:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你可以控制那个魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ghost that you could control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让它为你所用  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it work for you, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比深处饥饿的它更强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}were stronger than this deep hungry thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}sickness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你需要你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need your soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we make a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.47,0:08:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你了解交易的吧  强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about making deals, don't you Johnny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice bike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.84,0:08:25.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This child...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他现在很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们不止要他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for more than his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.35,0:08:33.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要去拯救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}will save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拯救...\N{\fnArial\fs30}save...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.17,0:08:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人\N{\fnArial\fs30}people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看看你待的地方  强尼·布雷兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch what you out here Johnny Blaze?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,背井离乡上万里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of miles from your place of birth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,远离你黑暗重生的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your dark rebirth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:08:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你被带到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're brought here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是为了拯救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.05,0:09:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你凭什么相信我能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think I can find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多年前你遇到的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man that you met{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对你施加了诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}years ago that put the curse on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,洛亚克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roarke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恶魔有很多名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil has many names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.29,0:09:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他就是你和这个男孩的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the link that connects you to this child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让骑士顺着本性  你会找到男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let The Rider follow his stench will lead you to the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你提到了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said something about a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的主教们的教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Church of my Masters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.15,0:09:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很古老\N{\fnArial\fs30}is an ancient one.{\r}
