Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.02,0:23:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把这孩子看做电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the child was sort of computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:02.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,电脑你懂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know computers, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.73,0:23:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是上传了一个程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just upload it a little program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.19,0:23:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个防火墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A firewall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.97,0:23:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们那个摩托车手朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our friend on the motorcycle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.85,0:23:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就察觉不到他...无法追踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}won't be able to sense him now... to track him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.09,0:23:15.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.31,0:23:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他仍有可能找到你  所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is still maybe able to find you. So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.09,0:23:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我建议你  继续跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest to you, keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.93,0:24:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁派你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent you to find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是魔鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it the Devil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.42,0:24:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,魔鬼还在人间行走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil walks among man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.68,0:24:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是恶魔  回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the Devil? Own you answer me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.38,0:24:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.04,0:24:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.68,0:24:36.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是你儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is your son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.23,0:24:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,子弹伤不了你  你有魔鬼附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullets can't hurt you anymore, and you work the Demon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.51,0:24:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但他们已经这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I think they've gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.72,0:24:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我凭什么相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why I can trust you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.22,0:24:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但如果我找不到你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I don't find your son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.94,0:24:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just assumed be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.99,0:25:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以如果你想开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you wanna pull that trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.68,0:25:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.54,0:25:06.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.25,0:25:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你昨晚追踪到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tracked us last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.66,0:25:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还能这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do it again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.46,0:25:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前我能感觉到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could feel him before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.44,0:25:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本来能  但之后就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could sense him, and then nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.43,0:25:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不不  他没死  只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. He's not dead! He's just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.34,0:25:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被封印了\N{\fnArial\fs30}blocked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.65,0:25:41.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.33,0:25:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们理理清楚...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah okay, look, let me just get something straight...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.74,0:25:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那家伙绑架了丹尼...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy who kidnapped Danny...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.09,0:25:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想杀了你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And try to kill you and blow me up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.63,0:25:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用榴弹炸死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}with grenades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.71,0:26:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们俩以前是情侣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two were like boyfriend and girlfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.91,0:26:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡瑞曾是个枪手...毒品贩子  雇佣军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrigan was a gunrunner... A drug dealer and a mercenary...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.82,0:26:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我什么都不在乎  只想出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't care about any of that. I just searched to get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.32,0:26:11.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧  那丹尼是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, ok! So Danny...is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.41,0:26:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是什么  卡瑞的儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny what? Is Carrigan's son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.67,0:26:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.32,0:26:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你遇到恶魔时...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you met the seducer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.81,0:26:23.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-他答应你什么了吗  -是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He offered you something? - Yeah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.71,0:26:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救活我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.73,0:26:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很意外  他撒了谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocker. He lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.28,0:26:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而我  是为了我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me... it was only myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.62,0:26:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这本来是卡瑞惹的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to be big screwed in Carrigan,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.46,0:26:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是他执迷不悟\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he want bad...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.30,0:26:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我死里逃生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I maded it out of third floor into hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.28,0:26:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,口吐鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was choking on my own blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.04,0:26:44.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道难逃一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew! I was gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.18,0:26:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,死神触手可及\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.75,0:26:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后它发现了我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when he found me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.04,0:26:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看起来需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you could use a little help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.76,0:26:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,洛亚克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roarke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.86,0:26:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他答应把疼痛带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He promised to take the pain away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.70,0:26:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拯救我的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.09,0:27:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是他提出了交换条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he asked for something in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.27,0:27:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.65,0:27:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许你永远不会理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can never understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.30,0:27:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不...我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No... I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.86,0:27:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是魔鬼的代孕妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the Devil's baby mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.91,0:27:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难怪莫鲁那么想要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that explains why Moreau wants...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.30,0:27:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼  非常急切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny. So bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.68,0:27:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对  黑皮法语酒精牧师混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah... Black-French-alcoholic-priest-kind-of-dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.31,0:27:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么  认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You know him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.07,0:27:28.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他要帮我们  我没让\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to help us. I didn't let him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.03,0:27:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以后我们一块决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were both gonna work on our decision making.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.91,0:27:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you headed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.19,0:27:35.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找个故人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To someone I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.99,0:27:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他为卡瑞做那些不法勾当\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does Carrigan's dirty work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.33,0:27:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他知道他的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll know where to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.81,0:27:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么恶魔要以人形行走世间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does the Devil walk on earth in human form anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.82,0:27:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.48,0:27:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许他自己也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he doesn't know either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.33,0:27:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许他只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.29,0:27:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从一个躯体移到另一个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}passes on from body to body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.55,0:27:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一直如此下去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down through history...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.79,0:27:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等待最完美的肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for the perfect fit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.59,0:28:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是  有一件事我肯定...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I know one thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.64,0:28:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}On earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.91,0:28:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他很虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's weak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.50,0:28:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他的力量被限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}His powers are limited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.76,0:28:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他需要帮凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs emissaries{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.45,0:28:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来为虎作伥\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do his dirty work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.83,0:28:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以他找到他们或创造他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he finds them or makes them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.91,0:28:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用他强大无比的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using his greatest power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.33,0:28:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这力量就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.61,0:28:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.72,0:28:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我能开窗透透气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I open a window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.22,0:28:36.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你以为你有资格讲话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you can just talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.54,0:28:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你妈以为她有资格讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, your mom thought that she could just talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.99,0:28:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直到我巴掌扇在你吉普赛人的脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I get doing your gypsy face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.97,0:29:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡瑞  救我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrigan get me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.03,0:29:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在地狱里好好享受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy yourself in the twinkie's hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.15,0:29:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.39,0:29:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.95,0:30:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.93,0:30:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再跑一次试试...你会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try that again... you will return...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.23,0:30:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会讲英语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak English?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.69,0:30:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会  伙计  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dude! What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.99,0:30:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是你的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your Van?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.98,0:30:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh... yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.96,0:30:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-能用吗  -当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it in run? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.11,0:31:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,搞定后  继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we get over... go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.43,0:31:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,骑士就要出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rider's going to come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.47,0:31:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,骑士出来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he does{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.82,0:31:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任何挡路者必死\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll destroy whoever he's got it coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.83,0:31:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,娜佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nadya...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.67,0:31:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.95,0:31:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有缘由...\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no reason...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.88,0:31:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或者意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}or conscious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.11,0:31:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hunger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.90,0:31:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在它眼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.56,0:31:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你和卡瑞没什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not different than Carrigan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.03,0:31:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但和他们又很不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're different than any of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.74,0:31:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不惧怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.63,0:31:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
