Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.58,0:45:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还没结束呢  卡瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not done, Carrigan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.58,0:45:45.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要把娜佳的儿子带给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to bring me Nadya's son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.86,0:45:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我期待你能完成给你的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do expect you to fulfill your obligation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.67,0:45:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉  蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}S...S...S... sorry, jackass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.87,0:46:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可我要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.12,0:46:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inconvenient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.08,0:46:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你把我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you do to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.46,0:47:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给了你第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave you a second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.83,0:47:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你现在和活着差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a little less than alive now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.08,0:47:10.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甚至更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}But also more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.62,0:47:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,瞧...我给了你力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}See... I have given you power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.39,0:47:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,腐蚀的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of decay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.01,0:47:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以及黑暗的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}of darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.44,0:48:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要那孩子  卡瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that boy, Carrigan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.94,0:48:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要再讲什么借口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you've got no excuses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.67,0:48:15.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,昨晚的那个机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machine last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.51,0:48:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-怎么  -你让它变形了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You made it changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.51,0:48:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是他的能力  他操作的东西随他而变\N{\fnArial\fs30}That how it works. Whatever he rides, changes with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.21,0:48:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那他坐的士怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if you took the taxi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.13,0:48:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这  我...我不清楚  不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, I... I don't know, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.13,0:48:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过山车或者滑雪缆车或...\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rollercoaster or ski lift at tow or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.80,0:48:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你燃烧的时候要是想撒尿怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What if you have to pee when you're on fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.14,0:48:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, it's awesome,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.40,0:48:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像喷火器  你知道  就像...\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's like a flame thrower. You know, it's like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.37,0:49:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当你改变  变成他时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you change, when you him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.09,0:49:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感觉好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}does it feel good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.59,0:49:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有时候是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.04,0:49:19.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么意思  很糟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that mean? All just bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.36,0:49:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.08,0:49:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们拥有的力量  来自黑暗世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}This power that we have, comes from the dark place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.58,0:49:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但不是我们的本来面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not who we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.42,0:49:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也永远不会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.40,0:49:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以用它做好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can use it to the good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.12,0:49:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去助人为乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.12,0:49:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像我在帮助你和你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I am helping you and your mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.29,0:49:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道你为什么要帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why are you helping us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.14,0:49:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她说你想摆脱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says you wanna get rid of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.20,0:49:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我却摆脱不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.65,0:49:57.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonjour!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.70,0:50:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,娜佳  希望你别再开枪打我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Nadya, I hope you have finished shooting at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.38,0:50:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想找点乐子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! You wanna have some fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.24,0:50:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.52,0:51:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.11,0:52:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是莫鲁的幸福之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is it Moreau's happy place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.73,0:52:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是说这些人能解除我的诅咒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean these guys gonna lift my curse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.88,0:52:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们甚至连鞋都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't even have shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.91,0:52:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,桑格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.23,0:53:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,毋须害怕  是神指引你们来此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mustn't be afraid. It was God that let you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.26,0:53:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.52,0:53:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道  有点太拘谨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know! A little too uptight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.89,0:53:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等了解他们后就感觉不赖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not so bad when you get to know them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.04,0:53:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.50,0:53:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们会好好照顾你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will take good care of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.30,0:53:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们俩去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.10,0:53:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去去就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will join you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.70,0:53:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们之间还有些事要完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have some business to complete between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.80,0:53:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我向你保证过  强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a promise to you, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.32,0:53:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他为什么不能和我们一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't he come with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.98,0:53:39.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.96,0:53:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼  丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny. Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.64,0:53:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这里你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.56,0:53:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.77,0:53:50.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在唯一能伤害你和你妈妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that can hurt you and your mom now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.37,0:53:52.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}is me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.36,0:53:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要确保那永远不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to make sure that will never happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.13,0:53:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.91,0:54:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.57,0:54:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-好吧  -我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whatever. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.35,0:54:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.32,0:54:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.99,0:54:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.28,0:54:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去我最喜欢的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my favorite world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.13,0:54:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说起这些混球们最了解的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they ask one thing these sons of bitches know out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.94,0:54:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是葡萄酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.14,0:54:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这瓶拍出了五万欧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bottle was fetch fifty thousand Euros at an auction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.89,0:54:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-莫鲁  -爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Moreau. - Oh. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.12,0:54:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.94,0:54:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-这是  -我说的是我身体里的那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's... - It's thing inside of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.27,0:54:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在我们动手之前  我想知道它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to know before we commence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.69,0:54:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,扎拉朵思  曾是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zarados, was an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.10,0:54:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是正义之灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spirit of justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.07,0:55:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他被派来保护人类世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent to protect the world of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.14,0:55:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是  却被欺骗  被俘获\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, he was tricked, captured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.96,0:55:13.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最终拖入了地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought down to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.60,0:55:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他渐渐堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corrupted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.45,0:55:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,变得疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driven insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.86,0:55:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他保护无辜的人使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}His mission to protect the innocent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.36,0:55:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,堕落成了惩罚恶者欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}was perverted into a lust to punish the guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.48,0:55:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它变成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It became...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.18,0:55:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,复仇之魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}the spirit of vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.55,0:55:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个天使呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the angel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.37,0:55:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正义之灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spirit justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.37,0:55:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.53,0:55:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还在某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.67,0:55:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.80,0:55:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你能感觉到他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.92,0:56:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.00,0:56:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开心点吧  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheer up, my man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.61,0:56:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很快你就能得到自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon you'll be free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.89,0:56:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这一瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.89,0:56:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这瓶已经超过两千年\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is over two thousand years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.42,0:56:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看上它有段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had my eye on it for while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.81,0:56:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这一切都结束的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this is over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.10,0:56:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们一起来喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will share it too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.23,0:56:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有什么没告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.09,0:56:42.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的诅咒很不容易消除\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing that your curse done to you, is not easily undone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.63,0:56:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你会有生命危险  比死亡更严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You risk death, worse than death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.48,0:56:55.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你必须忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must confess,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.41,0:57:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那件最难以启齿的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one thing that is most difficult for you to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.95,0:57:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.01,0:57:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我当初不是为了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do it for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.84,0:57:24.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是他为我做的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made the deal for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.39,0:57:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没办法就这样失去他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.47,0:57:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我太自私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was selfish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.14,0:57:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他已经做好了死亡的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was ready to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.43,0:57:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他知道是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew it was his time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.35,0:57:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我却以为我可以改变它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought I could change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.53,0:57:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.87,0:58:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是上帝的羔羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Lamb of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.92,0:58:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它可以带走世间的罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}That takes away all the sin from the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.77,0:58:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,降福于所有被选中的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy all those that are called to receive Him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.67,0:58:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还没有准备好见主吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say, that you're not ready to receive Him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.10,0:58:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的  还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.54,0:58:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的  这样就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok. That's good enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.07,0:58:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,耶稣的躯体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The body of Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.02,0:58:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.02,0:58:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你带着这块面包有段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you've been carrying this bread around for while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.56,0:58:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,愿上帝带你得到永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}May God lead you into the eternal life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.02,0:58:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,强尼  如果今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is John, if today,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.86,0:58:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,确实是你最后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in fact, your last...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.87,0:58:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在你要去的地方  我不能跟随\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you go now, I can not follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.42,0:58:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.41,0:59:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.24,0:59:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.38,0:59:27.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要动手就快点  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it quick, you asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.51,0:59:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做交易吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the deal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.78,1:00:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.31,1:00:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.68,1:00:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.13,1:00:28.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.13,1:00:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.65,1:00:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.31,1:00:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.32,1:00:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.91,1:00:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.96,1:00:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.13,1:00:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.81,1:00:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-松手  -你们想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off me! - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.55,1:00:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.92,1:00:55.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.48,1:00:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完成必须做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.18,1:01:04.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天就是预言日了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day of prophecy is tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.21,1:01:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在危险过去之前要看好那个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd like to hold the boy until the danger passes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.11,1:01:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要这个男孩还存在  莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The danger will not pass, Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.76,1:01:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,危险就不会过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as the boy exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.30,1:01:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,力量会一直在他体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power always be inside of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.52,1:01:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.93,1:01:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你居然骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.47,1:01:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个孩子必须被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This child must be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.41,1:01:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怀孕的时候就该阻止这一切发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might have protested while the child has been conceived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.12,1:01:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在已经太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it is too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.30,1:01:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完事之前先把他们关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them away until the thing is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.11,1:01:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼的灵魂可以被拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny's soul can still be saved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.27,1:02:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个孩子  他是上帝的子女\N{\fnArial\fs30}That boy. He's one of the God's children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.63,1:02:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不  他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! He's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.55,1:03:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,帅气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty neat ,huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.55,1:03:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安息吧  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.02,1:03:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.75,1:03:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,见到我高兴不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you happy to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.46,1:04:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是丹尼做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Danny do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.30,1:04:26.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.07,1:04:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人来了  在他们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody got here, before they could...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.78,1:04:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在他们杀掉他之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they could kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.29,1:04:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,四处都找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no sign of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.30,1:04:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无论这是谁干的  都想让他活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did this wanted him to be alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.58,1:04:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我们都知道谁干的  莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we all have pretty good idea who that would be, Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.62,1:04:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他现在和洛亚克在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, so now he is with Roarke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.28,1:04:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,类似你曾经那样的守护者是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some protectors you turned out to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.45,1:04:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,洛亚克到底想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly just Roarke have in mind for the enemy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.47,1:04:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在计划什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is his plan for his size?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.23,1:04:49.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道是为上大学存钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he putting money away for college, or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.95,1:04:52.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天就是预言日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the day of prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.79,1:04:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像丹尼受孕的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}As was the day Danny was conceived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.96,1:04:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孩子必须长到13岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child must be in his 13th year,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.72,1:05:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才能在冬至的破晓实施仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the rite can be performed on the dawn of the new winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.04,1:05:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.03,1:05:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,洛亚克将那孩子用作容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roarke fathered the boy as a vessel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.94,1:05:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,装载他力量的容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a container for his power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.77,1:05:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仪式可以把他的精髓\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ritual will transform his essence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.12,1:05:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他的灵魂  导入那孩子体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}his soul, into the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.84,1:05:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼就不复存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no more Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.54,1:05:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-只剩下洛亚克  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Only Roarke. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.37,1:05:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你为什么没有早告诉我们  莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell you didn't tell us this, Moreau?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.52,1:05:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明明是你和洛亚克做了交易  你们俩都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're the one who made the deal with Roarke! Both of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.88,1:05:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I would never do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.61,1:05:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧  预言日\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, the prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.78,1:05:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说仪式必须在黎明时举行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said, it had to happen at the dawn of new day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.32,1:05:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好  也许我们还有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. Maybe there's still time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.59,1:05:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道洛亚克会把他带到哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where Roarke has him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.72,1:05:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.91,1:05:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后呢  难道你想装英雄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what, so now you want to play hero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.45,1:05:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你已经达到目的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got what you wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.90,1:05:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.27,1:05:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你  信守承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, for holding up your end of the bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.76,1:05:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.45,1:05:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我人生的最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could spend the last day of my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.59,1:05:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以摆脱从地狱而来的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}as free man without a curse from hell hanging over my head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.89,1:05:49.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我当然求之不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll take that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.95,1:05:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我向丹尼保证过  他是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I promised Danny, he'd be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.75,1:05:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我现在离开  和魔鬼也没什么两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by walking away now, I'm just trading one demon for another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.79,1:05:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们动身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.46,1:06:07.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(乌兹卡哥克登  土耳其)
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.72,1:06:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-我办事还用担心吗  -不要碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was there really doubt? - Don't touch me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.80,1:06:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,贴得有点近了吧  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of get a bit close, aren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.63,1:06:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道我都经历了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea, what I had to go through?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.65,1:06:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就为了抓住这个小混账\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get this little turd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.55,1:06:50.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,计划又与你的异教徒集会无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the plan is don't align{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.46,1:06:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要到明天破晓才能进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your little pagan party until daybreak tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.36,1:06:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以不要烦我  我已经提前完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So get off my ass, cause I'd say, I'm ahead of schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.69,1:07:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.99,1:07:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道我是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.72,1:07:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你妈妈一定和你说了不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure your mother told you a lot of things about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.10,1:07:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的脸怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with your face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.14,1:07:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,乌兹卡哥克登  离天堂最远的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uzak Gokten, the furthest point from heaven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.70,1:07:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仪式将在那里举行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is where the ritual is to take place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.58,1:07:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正如预言那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}according to the prophecy of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.01,1:07:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.58,1:07:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有了恶灵骑士  我们想战胜洛亚克很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without The Rider, we stand very little chance against Roarke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.92,1:07:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-我以为你应该有信心  -我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought, you're supposed to have faith? - I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.21,1:07:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是同时  我们也需要武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}But also, I think we should have weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.87,1:07:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,枪与葡萄酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns and wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.05,1:07:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,调皮的神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naughty priests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.03,1:07:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我又开始喜欢你了  莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to like you again Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.81,1:08:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想知道为什么我会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to know, why I look this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.79,1:08:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就想想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.38,1:08:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喷火器\N{\fnArial\fs30}the flame thrower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.19,1:08:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that funny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.37,1:08:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧  我这个形状的喷火器确实搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flame thrower made out of the paper my shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.17,1:08:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.83,1:08:38.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想用的话  就要点燃自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to use it, you burn up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.68,1:08:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的这幅躯干  很弱小\N{\fnArial\fs30}This body, I'm living in, it's weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.95,1:08:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人类的躯干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.53,1:08:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它在枯竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.36,1:08:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无法让我随心所欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was never made to do the things that I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.00,1:08:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是你  你并不全是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you. You're only part human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.32,1:09:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你可以掌控我给你的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will rule the power that I have inside of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.54,1:09:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像子承父业一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like father like son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.76,1:09:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是这个实体\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this corporeal form{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.88,1:09:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以支配力量  但不伤及自身\N{\fnArial\fs30}can wield the power, without burning itself up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.01,1:09:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,帮你休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help you relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.60,1:09:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,够他一直睡到仪式了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will keep him sedated until the ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.79,1:09:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些都是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.74,1:09:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政客  杀手  掌权者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Politicians, murderers, people of influence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.74,1:10:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都是恶魔的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil's soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.56,1:10:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们从世界各地而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've traveled from all over the world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.44,1:10:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为亲眼目睹新帝王的诞生\N{\fnArial\fs30}to witness of the uniting of The New King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.58,1:10:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新帝王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The New King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.84,1:10:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别搞笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.19,1:10:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果洛亚克成功  就会有一个新形态\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Roarke succeeds, we have a new form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.47,1:10:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比以往都要强大的形态\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more powerful than is ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.85,1:10:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他的阴霾将笼罩世间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his shadow will fall upon the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.57,1:11:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二十度角五个  三十度九个  里面更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty five, thirty nine. More inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.66,1:11:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仪式已经开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ritual has already begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.93,1:11:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼的灵魂会在破晓永远的消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny's soul will be lost forever at the break of dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.25,1:11:18.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那时的洛亚克最虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is when Roarke is at his weakest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.98,1:11:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,娜佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nadya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.92,1:11:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.85,1:11:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我犯过很多错误  布雷兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made a lot of mistakes, Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.03,1:11:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Danny,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.82,1:11:55.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,生下丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny is the one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.80,1:11:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我这辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one good thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.35,1:12:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做过最对的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ever did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.15,1:12:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是那样的话  我们最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That being the case, we had better{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.11,1:12:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,确保他不要被变成反基督徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure he doesn't turn out to be the anti-Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.37,1:13:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-时间不多了  -计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not much time? - What's the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.31,1:13:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你去抢走那男孩  逃跑  不要停\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you go and grab the boy, you run, and you don't stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.41,1:13:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.72,1:13:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.39,1:13:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我从正面攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going through the front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.66,1:13:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.90,1:13:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无比荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't be my bigger honor, sour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.99,1:13:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,强尼·布雷兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.90,1:13:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上帝保佑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bona me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.30,1:13:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.16,1:13:47.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonjour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.24,1:13:51.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尝尝这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this one out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.79,1:13:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好酒浪费了真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a waste of good wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.49,1:13:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,窝火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.22,1:15:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.47,1:15:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能听到我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you listen to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.47,1:15:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不该舍弃那力量  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never of gone rid of the power, I know that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.59,1:15:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他想让你的灵魂消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna erase you Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.36,1:16:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.13,1:16:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我依然可以看见光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still see the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.19,1:16:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.86,1:16:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没有力量了  布雷兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no power Blaze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.82,1:16:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在我面前你不过是蝼蚁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing but an insect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.71,1:16:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甚至更糟  成为魔鬼的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the worst, food for the meals of hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.13,1:17:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想来观看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you wanna watch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.91,1:17:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有其父必有其子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apple doesn't rot far from the tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.79,1:17:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.28,1:17:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.31,1:17:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,永远也不会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.41,1:17:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们两个能力相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}My powers and yours are the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.02,1:17:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是这么说的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you said. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.69,1:17:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸  像子承父业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad? Like father like son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.97,1:18:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.23,1:18:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.68,1:21:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.94,1:23:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我从来没怕过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was never afraid of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.93,1:23:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Road kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.31,1:24:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.54,1:25:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我做过最差的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}were the worst fucking deal, I ever made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.07,1:25:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,滚回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.94,1:25:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.49,1:27:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.53,1:27:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫鲁说过骑士曾经是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreau says The Rider was an Angel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.38,1:27:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,变疯的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}that went crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.69,1:27:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以感觉到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.73,1:27:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.31,1:27:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我能感到他的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.71,1:27:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.66,1:27:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.89,1:28:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们赢了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we win?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.17,1:28:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna say yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.40,1:28:11.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.97,1:28:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是强尼·布雷兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Johnny Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.96,1:28:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是恶灵骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Ghost Rider.{\r}
